  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of species having non-pyramidal shape among the following is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math></p>"
  },
