  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0138_67753e9c3015.png\" style=\"width: 542px; height: 123px;\" /></p><p>Hence non-pyramidal species are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo></msup></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>.</p>"
